{"id":"torrey:sieges","source":"torrey","name":"Sieges","slug":"sieges","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Fenced cities invested by — 2Ki 18:13.","refs":[["2Kgs",18,13,18,13]]},{"text":"Threatened as a punishment — De 28:52.","refs":[["Deut",28,52,28,52]]},{"text":"Encamping against. — 2Sa 12:28; 2Ch 32:1.","refs":[["2Sam",12,28,12,28],["2Chr",32,1,32,1]]},{"text":"Pitching against. — 2Ki 25:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",25,1,25,1]]},{"text":"Compassing about with armies. — 2Ki 6:14; Lu 21:20.","refs":[["2Kgs",6,14,6,14],["Luke",21,20,21,20]]},{"text":"Setting in array against. — Jer 50:9.","refs":[["Jer",50,9,50,9]]},{"text":"Being against round about. — Jer 51:2.","refs":[["Jer",51,2,51,2]]},{"text":"Often lasted for a long time — 2Ki 17:5.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,5,17,5]]},{"text":"Great noise and tumult of, alluded to — Joe 2:5.","refs":[["Joel",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Built forts and mounts. — Eze 4:2; 26:8.","refs":[["Ezek",4,2,4,2],["Ezek",26,8,26,8]]},{"text":"Dug a trench round the city. — Lu 19:43.","refs":[["Luke",19,43,19,43]]},{"text":"Invested the city on every side. — Eze 23:24.","refs":[["Ezek",23,24,23,24]]},{"text":"Cut off all supplies. — 2Ki 19:24.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,24,19,24]]},{"text":"Frequently laid ambushes. — Jdj 9:34.","refs":[["Judg",9,34,9,34]]},{"text":"Called upon the city to surrender. — 1Ki 20:2,3; 2Ki 18:18,20.","refs":[["1Kgs",20,2,20,2],["1Kgs",20,3,20,3],["2Kgs",18,18,18,18],["2Kgs",18,20,18,20]]},{"text":"Employed battering rams against the walls. — Eze 4:2; 26:9.","refs":[["Ezek",4,2,4,2],["Ezek",26,9,26,9]]},{"text":"Cast arrows and other missiles into the city. — 2Ki 19:32.","refs":[["2Kgs",19,32,19,32]]},{"text":"Often suffered much during. — Eze 29:18.","refs":[["Ezek",29,18,29,18]]},{"text":"The Jews forbidden to cut down fruit trees for the purpose of — De 20:19,20.","refs":[["Deut",20,19,20,19],["Deut",20,20,20,20]]},{"text":"Extreme difficulty of taking cities by, alluded to — Pr 18:19.","refs":[["Prov",18,19,18,19]]},{"text":"Repaired and newly fortified beforehand. — 2Ch 32:5; Isa 22:9,10; Na 3:14.","refs":[["2Chr",32,5,32,5],["Isa",22,9,22,9],["Isa",22,10,22,10],["Nah",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"Supplied with water beforehand. — Na 3:14.","refs":[["Nah",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"The inhabitants of, cut off beforehand supplies of water outside, useful to besiegers. — 2Ch 32:3,4.","refs":[["2Chr",32,3,32,3],["2Chr",32,4,32,4]]},{"text":"Were strictly shut up. — Jos 6:1.","refs":[["Josh",6,1,6,1]]},{"text":"Walls of, defended by the inhabitants. — 2Sa 11:20,21; 2Ki 18:26; 2Ch 32:18.","refs":[["2Sam",11,20,11,20],["2Sam",11,21,11,21],["2Kgs",18,26,18,26],["2Chr",32,18,32,18]]},{"text":"Sometimes used ambushes or sorties. — Jer 51:12.","refs":[["Jer",51,12,51,12]]},{"text":"Often suffered from famine. — 2Ki 6:26-29; 25:3; Eze 6:12.","refs":[["2Kgs",6,26,6,29],["2Kgs",25,3,25,3],["Ezek",6,12,6,12]]},{"text":"Often suffered from pestilence. — Jer 21:6; 32:24.","refs":[["Jer",21,6,21,6],["Jer",32,24,32,24]]},{"text":"Often demanded terms of peace. — 1Sa 11:1-3.","refs":[["1Sam",11,1,11,3]]},{"text":"Frequently taken by ambush. — Jdj 9:43,44.","refs":[["Judg",9,43,9,43],["Judg",9,44,9,44]]},{"text":"Frequently taken by assault. — Jos 10:35; 2Sa 12:29.","refs":[["Josh",10,35,10,35],["2Sam",12,29,12,29]]},{"text":"Frequently helped by allies. — 1Sa 11:11; 23:5.","refs":[["1Sam",11,11,11,11],["1Sam",23,5,23,5]]},{"text":"Inhabitants of, exhorted to be courageous. — 2Ch 32:6-8.","refs":[["2Chr",32,6,32,8]]},{"text":"Given up to pillage. — Jer 50:26,27.","refs":[["Jer",50,26,50,26],["Jer",50,27,50,27]]},{"text":"Inhabitants of, often put to the sword. — Jos 10:28,30,32,35; Jer 50:30.","refs":[["Josh",10,28,10,28],["Josh",10,30,10,30],["Josh",10,32,10,32],["Josh",10,35,10,35],["Jer",50,30,50,30]]},{"text":"Frequently broken down. — Jdj 9:45.","refs":[["Judg",9,45,9,45]]},{"text":"Frequently destroyed by fire. — Jos 8:19.","refs":[["Josh",8,19,8,19]]},{"text":"Sometimes sown with salt. — Jdj 9:45.","refs":[["Judg",9,45,